<title>USA: Pratt Wylce &amp; Lords Ltd Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Pratt Wylce &amp; Lords Ltd Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>HILTON HEAD, S.C. 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.22		    $0.01</p>
<p> Net			    639			 15</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.68		    $0.07</p>
<p> Net			  1,950			170</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 Q3 income from operations was $629,636 or $0.22 per share on revenues of $1,369,198 and an additional $9,317 from investments. This compares to income from operations of $45,485 or $0.02 per share on revenues of $73,756 and a loss of ($30,568) or ($.01) per share from investments in the third quarter of last year.</p>
